</span></span>
<span id="A7.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<span id="A7.Ex73"><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></span>
<span class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex73.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad u=\frac{c}{n}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad u=\frac{c}{n},</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex74"><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></span>
<span class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex74.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad k^{\prime}=\frac{\omega^{\prime}}{u}=\frac{n\omega^{\prime}}{c}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ω</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ω</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad k^{\prime}=\frac{\omega^{\prime}}{u}=\frac{n\omega^{\prime}}{c},</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.Ex75"><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></span>
<span class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex75.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad\text{Continuity of phase at the moving interface: }\phi_{i}(z=Vt)=\phi_{t}(z=Vt)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">Continuity of phase at the moving interface: </mtext><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ϕ</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">i</mi></msub><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">V</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ϕ</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></msub><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">V</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad\text{Continuity of phase at the moving interface: }\phi_{i}(z=Vt)=\phi_{t}(z=Vt)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.30" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">

],
<span id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.30.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.31" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.31.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"rationale": "The student wrote the incident wave as <math id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\omega t-kz" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ω</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\omega t-kz</annotation></semantics></math>, which corresponds to a wave propagating upward; for light coming from above toward the interface (downward propagation) the sign of the spatial term is wrong. This incorrect sign gives the wrong expression for the incident phase at <math id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z=Vt" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z=Vt</annotation></semantics></math> and therefore leads to the incorrect algebraic relation and final formula for <math id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ν</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>. The use of phase continuity and <math id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k^{\prime}=n\omega^{\prime}/c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">ω</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">/</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k^{\prime}=n\omega^{\prime}/c</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u=c/n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">/</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u=c/n</annotation></semantics></math> are otherwise appropriate, so the error is an incorrect interpretation of the wave propagation direction (diagram/sign error)."
<span id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.31.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span><pre id="A7.SS3.p2.pic1.2.32" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
}
</pre>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A7.SS3.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="391.8" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 391.8" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,391.8) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B02418;" fill="#B02418" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.74 L 0 387.06 C 0 389.68 2.12 391.8 4.74 391.8 L 545.26 391.8 C 547.88 391.8 550 389.68 550 387.06 L 550 4.74 C 550 2.12 547.88 0 545.26 0 L 4.74 0 C 2.12 0 0 2.12 0 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F8E6EA;" fill="#F8E6EA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 4.74 L 1.97 351.08 L 548.03 351.08 L 548.03 4.74 C 548.03 3.21 546.79 1.97 545.26 1.97 L 4.74 1.97 C 3.21 1.97 1.97 3.21 1.97 4.74 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E197A8;" fill="#E197A8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 353.05 L 1.97 387.06 C 1.97 388.59 3.21 389.83 4.74 389.83 L 545.26 389.83 C 546.79 389.83 548.03 388.59 548.03 387.06 L 548.03 353.05 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.82 359.68)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.96em;--ltx-fo-height:1.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="28.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.21)" width="456.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
